FroggerPro device tree — provenance / attribution
==================================================

Upstream
--------
This device tree is a fork of:

    AmphibianArcade/android_device_nothing_FroggerPro   (branch: lineage-23.2)

It is based on upstream commit 8dfae7e. The upstream commit history is retained in
full and upstream is merged into this branch regularly. The large majority of the
files in this tree are upstream work; this fork's contribution is a delta on top of
it.

Local changes
-------------
Local changes are kept one item per commit, each stating the reason and the
on-device evidence that verifies it. The written record of every source/config
change — file, before/after, reason, how it was verified — lives in the project
CHANGELOG outside this repository.

Parts of the local delta were written with AI assistance and reviewed and verified
on device by the maintainer.

Attribution correction
----------------------
Commit fd54aa3 (2026-10-07, "Revert FroggerPro: sepolicy: label the
leds/battery/vibrator sysfs path family (contexts batch 1/25)") is a local
action by this fork's maintainer. It was committed under an incorrect author
identity (AmphibianArcade) and is not an action by the upstream project.
See also the local revert of the batch it reverts.

Third-party components
----------------------
The image this tree builds contains binary components taken from the stock
Nothing OS release (vendor, odm and system_ext content) and from AOSP and
LineageOS. They stay under their owners' terms and are not relicensed by this
repository. One example worth naming: the face unlock HAL reads
/vendor/etc/license.lic, the stock SenseTime FaceAuth licence file, copied
unchanged from the stock vendor image and required for the HAL to initialise.
That file lives in the local vendor blob directory, which is not part of this
repository.

